Package: macodgent
Title: Toolkit for Routine Medical Data Science Analysis
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Xie YJ", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "xiemacodgent@163.com"), person(given = "MA Codgent",
    role = c("cph")))
Maintainer: Xie YJ <xiemacodgent@163.com>
Description: A collection of reusable analysis functions derived from the second
    part of the Chinese column "Exploring Medical Data Science with R"
    ("Routine Analysis Techniques"). It covers data preprocessing, quantitative
    and qualitative descriptive statistics, conventional and advanced regression,
    survival analysis, competing-risk models, and models for transitions
    between multiple states.
    All exported functions use the 'mc_' prefix and return tidy data frames for
    direct use in reports and downstream workflows.
